{"product_id":"testament-of-youth","title":"TESTAMENT OF YOUTH","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn 1914 Vera Brittain was eighteen and, as war was declared, she was preparing to study at Oxford. Four years later her life - and the life of her whole generation - had changed in a way that was unimaginable in the tranquil pre-war era. TESTAMENT OF YOUTH, one of the most famous autobiographies of the First World War, is Brittain's account of how she survived the period; how she lost the man she loved; how she nursed the wounded and how she emerged into an altered world. A passionate record of a lost generation, it made Vera Brittain one of the best-loved writers of her time.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Vera Brittain\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780860680352\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 640\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45301760393369,"sku":"16RC-3-9780860680352","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67fcb63ed24b1_TESTAMENT_OF_YOUTH_Vera_Brittain.jpg?v=1744654245","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/testament-of-youth","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}